[[[[138.48052445496805, 285.3325844331255, "Members’ Attendance in the House of Assembly  "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 528.8341419945134, "Section 13 of the House of Assembly Accountability, Integrity and Administration Act requires that a Member "]], [[0.0002794650881909888, 538.3142528089804, "(excluding the Premier, the Leader of the Official Opposition and the Leader of a Third Party) attend the House "]], [[0.0002794650881909888, 463.5207897742066, "of Assembly when it is sitting, but outlines acceptable reasons for a Member’s absence, such as: "]], [[54.00022056210311, 192.59441480228136, "•    sickness of the Member; "]], [[54.00028044747917, 388.43415613633965, "•    adoption, pregnancy or parental leave as established by directive; "]], [[53.99974147909475, 305.4797995276266, "•    a serious illness related to the Member’s family; "]], [[53.99980136447081, 139.55404234929284, "•    bereavement; "]], [[53.99986124984683, 496.9144416875148, "•    attendance at a meeting of a committee of the House of Assembly, the Commission or a "]], [[71.99986823124118, 223.4340456744964, "committee of the Commission; "]], [[53.99992113522289, 539.3941398249235, "•    attendance to duties as a Member of a caucus, attendance to constituency business, or attendance "]], [[71.99992811661718, 194.03408941267577, "to ministerial duties; and "]], [[53.99998102059895, 311.6341434975675, "•    other circumstances as approved by the Speaker.  "]], [[0.0, 534.5941049397604, "By January 31 of each year, a Member is required to file with the Clerk a declaration under oath or affirmation "]], [[0.0, 528.4738337925339, "of his or her attendance while the House of Assembly was sitting in the previous year.  Dates of any absences "]], [[0.0, 276.95447678440587, "and an explanation for those absences must be provided.  "]], [[0.0, 516.9200593979667, "A deduction in the amount of $200 is made from the Member’s salary for each day the Member was absent "]], [[0.0, 484.0744544601404, "from a sitting of the House of Assembly for a reason other than those provided for in the legislation. "]], [[5.684341886080802e-14, 461.9942499486849, "In  its  report  Review  of  MHA  Salaries,  Allowances,  Severance  Payments  and  Pensions,"], [462.00039504696804, 542.0005517552734, "  the  Members’ "]], [[0.000688286924649617, 542.0004719560136, "Compensation Review Committee recommended that a copy of each Member’s Declaration of Attendance in "]], [[0.000688286924649617, 542.994332215972, "the House of Assembly as required by subsection 13(5) of the House of Assembly Accountability, Integrity and "]], [[0.0007880958847295005, 542.9951524300366, "Administration Act should be posted on the House of Assembly website. The Committee subsequently agreed "]], [[0.000887904844759646, 399.8346198883829, "that a table summarizing Members’ attendance would be an acceptable alternative. "]], [[0.000887904844759646, 177.71508745413317, "In response to this recommendation,"], [181.56050722296806, 542.9952600490745, "the House of Assembly Management Commission, at its March 24, 2010 "]], [[0.0010222167911138058, 542.0014191480619, "meeting, amended the House of Assembly Publication Scheme to provide that an annual summary of Members’ "]], [[0.00202030639182027, 403.5562735205152, "attendance in the House of Assembly be placed on the House of Assembly website. "]], [[0.00202030639182027, 542.995386039921, "The following table is the first such report to be posted in response to this recommendation. The report is a "]], [[0.0010222167910569624, 542.9954972989652, "summary of all Members’ attendance, including those who resigned or were elected during the reporting period "]], [[0.0010222167910569624, 468.95512997693913, "January 1 to December 31, 2009.  The House of Assembly had 43 sitting days during this period. "]], [[45.48055185717199, 494.40099474270653, "Summary of Members’ Attendance for the Period January 1, 2009 – December 31, 2009 "]], [[87.00117905791446, 460.9154309698